      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mount_Clemens%2C_Michigan",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The public library opened in 1865 on the Union School floor, later moving to a Carnegie building that now houses the Anton Art Center.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
